        "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MikeeeDeV/MikeeeDeV/zipball/v1.0.0",
        "body": "### ⚡ VectorForge v1.0.0 Release Notes\n\nWe are thrilled to ship the initial production release of **VectorForge**: the deterministic, zero-runtime-dependency developer SVG shape and component library.\n\n#### 🌟 Highlights\n- **235 Professional Developer Shapes**: Across 7 categories (Banners, Terminals, Skylines, Architectures, Badges, Repo Cards, Holograms).\n- **Zero External Runtime Dependencies**: 100% self-contained W3C SVG 1.1 assets, compliant with WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility.\n- **10 Curated Color Themes**: High-contrast palettes including Kemet Nocturne, Cyberpunk 2077, Nord Frost, Dracula, Tokyo Night, Monokai Pro, Emerald Matrix, Amber CRT, Solarized Dark, and Rosé Pine.\n- **Node.js & NPX Support**: Run directly via `npx vectorforge <cmd>` with zero install overhead.\n- **Python Package (PEP 621)**: `pip install vectorforge` with `vectorforge` CLI command.\n- **Model Context Protocol (FastMCP)**: Native stdio JSON-RPC MCP server (`vectorforge.mcp_server`) for Claude Desktop, Cursor, and AI agents.\n- **Reusable GitHub Action**: Pin with `uses: MikeeeDeV/MikeeeDeV@v1` in any repository workflow.\n- **Interactive Showroom Gallery**: Live on GitHub Pages at https://mikeeedev.github.io/MikeeeDeV/ with real-time React JSX export and 1-click jsDelivr CDN embeds.",
        "short_description_html": "<h3>⚡ VectorForge v1.0.0 Release Notes</h3>\n<p>We are thrilled to ship the initial production release of <strong>VectorForge</strong>: the deterministic, zero-runtime-dependency developer SVG shape and component library.</p>\n<h4>🌟 Hig…</h4>",
        "is_short_description_html_truncated": true
      }
